+# Seed shim-owned swtpm. Used only for sandboxes annotated with
+# seed.loom.farm/tpm-mode (create|verify), seed.loom.farm/tpm-state-dir and,
+# for verify, seed.loom.farm/tpm-fingerprint. The shim then checks the
